1
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:09,344
There were three of them now.

2
00:00:09,913 --> 00:00:15,813
Samira Haddad came up from Atlanta in May, on her
own time and her own money, and sat

3
00:00:15,833 --> 00:00:21,802
at Owen Carrick's kitchen table in Media with Hannah
Price and a laptop, and the three

4
00:00:21,822 --> 00:00:24,378
of them laid out everything they had.

5
00:00:24,949 --> 00:00:31,261
A blood sample that broke an analyzer. A dead
scientist who had seen red eyes. A deacon

6
00:00:31,281 --> 00:00:37,448
who had seen a machine breathe. A photograph of a
grey figure in a capsule, explained

7
00:00:37,468 --> 00:00:43,780
by a sculpture. A table of monkeys, explained by an
