9
00:00:50,569 --> 00:00:56,882
A freight elevator with a blank steel plate. A
security guard who did not blink. A past

10
00:00:56,902 --> 00:01:01,685
that was too perfect to be real. And forty
metres, in four frames.

11
00:01:03,375 --> 00:01:06,000
If you put this in front of a
jury, they'd laugh.

12
00:01:06,521 --> 00:01:08,522
If you put it in front of a jury.

13
00:01:09,040 --> 00:01:11,004
What else would you put it in front of?

14
00:01:12,525 --> 00:01:17,875
I don't know yet. But I know what it is. Every
