15
00:01:17,895 --> 00:01:23,245
Every single explanation was ready before we asked.
That isn't a company with nothing

16
00:01:23,265 --> 00:01:28,426
to hide. That's a company that has already been
where we're going, and cleaned up.

17
00:01:30,445 --> 00:01:36,273
They called themselves nothing. They never gave it a
name, because naming it would have

18
00:01:36,293 --> 00:01:42,187
