22
00:01:59,286 --> 00:02:01,228
Carrick wrote the memo in June.

23
00:02:01,798 --> 00:02:07,899
It was forty-one pages long. He wrote it carefully,
and rewrote it four times, and cut

24
00:02:07,919 --> 00:02:14,732
every word that sounded like a man who had lost his mind.
It was titled, in the end, Preliminary

25
00:02:14,752 --> 00:02:21,068
Assessment of Anomalous Physiological Capabilities
Associated with a Subject of Interest,

26
00:02:21,088 --> 00:02:27,189
and it recommended that the Bureau open a full
counter-intelligence investigation into

27
00:02:27,209 --> 00:02:33,738
the chief executive of Umbrella Life Sciences, on the
grounds that he might not be — Carrick

28
00:02:33,758 --> 00:02:37,937
