times — a natural person.

29
00:02:39,627 --> 00:02:41,695
Owen. I've read it. All of it. Twice.

30
00:02:42,217 --> 00:02:42,852
And?

31
00:02:43,372 --> 00:02:47,911
And it's the most careful thing you've ever written.
And I'm recommending that you take

32
00:02:47,931 --> 00:02:51,946
