36
00:03:10,215 --> 00:03:15,507
to run, and a United States Attorney who had
stopped taking her calls about Umbrella,

37
00:03:15,527 --> 00:03:19,881
and a phone that kept ringing with polite
enquiries from Capitol Hill.

38
00:03:21,951 --> 00:03:28,035
The first scandal arrived in July, and it was not
about Albert Wesker. It was about Owen

39
00:03:28,055 --> 00:03:28,589
Carrick.

40
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:35,176
A member of the Senate Judiciary Committee — a
senator from a state where Umbrella had

41
00:03:35,196 --> 00:03:41,352
