hundred jobs — received, from a source

42
00:03:41,372 --> 00:03:47,459
he described only as a concerned whistleblower, a
set of internal budget documents from

43
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:53,565
the FBI's Philadelphia field office. The documents
showed that the office had spent two

44
00:03:53,585 --> 00:03:59,531
point three million dollars over thirteen months
investigating a biotech company that

45
00:03:59,551 --> 00:04:06,129
