48
00:04:17,930 --> 00:04:22,241
The headline wrote itself. Several
newspapers were happy to let it.

49
00:04:22,810 --> 00:04:28,743
The senator held a hearing. He did not mention
Carrick by name. He did not need to. He

50
00:04:28,763 --> 00:04:35,113
spoke with feeling about American innovators, and about
