52
00:04:41,294 --> 00:04:47,159
He called a witness — a retired Army Ranger who had
lost his mother to frailty before

53
00:04:47,179 --> 00:04:49,029
Aeterna existed — who wept.

54
00:04:49,598 --> 00:04:56,062
Owen Carrick was reassigned the following week.
Hazmat drills. Chemistry lectures. The

55
00:04:56,082 --> 00:04:57,269
man in Scranton.

56
00:04:59,338 --> 00:05:04,823
The second scandal was quieter, and so quiet that
nobody ever noticed it was one.

57
00:05:05,392 --> 00:05:11,776
Samira Haddad's report — a careful, forty-page
recommendation that the CDC conduct a full,

58
00:05:11,796 --> 00:05:17,824
unannounced biosafety audit of every Umbrella
facility in the United States — went up

59
00:05:17,844 --> 00:05:24,015
the chain in Atlanta in July. It reached a deputy
assistant secretary at the Department

60
00:05:24,035 --> 00:05:30,347
of Health and Human Services in August. It was still
there in October. It was still there

61
00:05:30,367 --> 00:05:36,538
in December. It was never rejected. It was simply
never read, by a department that had,

62
00:05:36,558 --> 00:05:42,728
