Umbrella tower, and a man got out.

121
00:10:49,582 --> 00:10:55,111
He was lean, somewhere in his late fifties, with
silver hair and a navy suit and no tie,

122
00:10:55,131 --> 00:11:00,534
and the kind of face that has spent a long career
being forgettable on purpose. He did

123
00:11:00,554 --> 00:11:06,020
not have an appointment. He walked into the lobby,
past the living wall, past the Creed

124
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:11,442
in its small elegant letters, to the reception desk,
where a receptionist who had once

125
00:11:11,462 --> 00:11:16,550
